      </Step>
      </Steps>
      <h2 id="open-the-project-in-the-editor" class="group scroll-mt-20">Open the project in the editor<a href="#open-the-project-in-the-editor" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-pagefind-ignore>&para;</a></h2>
      <p>If you use the DogsBay XML editor, open the clone as a project. The <code>.dogsbay/config.xml</code> on every stage branch sets the project type to DITA, the framework to DITA-OT 4.3.5 and the format style, so the editor and the gate agree on what a valid, well-formatted file is.</p>
